  "body": "The Blueprint.\r\nSecure this increasingly rare opportunity to own a home and legal minor dwelling on 1100sqm of ideally-shaped, freehold land in sought-after Olde Torbay coastal village. This is a substantial holding, offering two fully independent dwellings, and future potential in Residential-Mixed Housing Suburban Zone.\r\nThe walk-to-selection of beaches location and sunny position make this ideal living for families of all ages and stages who would like the added advantage of an attractive home and income with great separation between outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nThe north-facing, 206sqm main homestead comprises four bedrooms and four internal access garages, offering flexibility for families, teens, extended living or working from home. \r\n\r\nGenerous living and dining areas are filled with natural light, floored with native timber and flow easily outdoors to the expansive sundeck – ideal for entertaining, children, or simply relaxing in sunny privacy. Comfortable as is, there is clear scope to modernise and add value over time.\r\n\r\nAt the far end of the property, the legal 70sqm minor dwelling is well positioned for independence. Offering two bedrooms, a bathroom, a sizeable loft, and light-filled living, it provides excellent separation for tenants or extended family.\r\n\r\nThe infrastructure here is impressive. Two separate single garages plus a dedicated double boat or tractor garage and extensive off-street parking create genuine practicality for multiple vehicles, trailers or watercraft.\r\n\r\nIncome today. Options tomorrow.\r\n\r\nCurrently fully rented, the property provides holding income while you consider longer-term plans. With its rectangular shape and generous site dimensions, there is clear potential to explore subdivision between the two dwellings or further redevelopment (subject to Council approval). \r\n\r\nZoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, and only minutes to Torbay Village, Waiake Beach and glorious Long Bay, both you and your tenants will love the beach walks and coastal lifestyle here.\r\n\r\nLegal Home and Income. Coastal Ambience. Larger than the Kiwi Quarter Acre.\r\n\r\nProperties like this are tightly held for good reason.\r\n\r\nCall Shane or Jen today to find out more, and to make your private viewing appointment.",
